sn35.242:1.3 | S: he addressed the mendicants: | T: and he addressed the bhikkhus thus:
sn35.242:1.4 | S: “Mendicants, do you see that large tree trunk being carried along by the current of the Ganges River?” | T: “Do you see, bhikkhus, that great log being carried along by the current of the river Ganges?”
