sn35.2:1.3 | S: And what’s not-self should be truly seen with right understanding like this: ‘This is not mine, I am not this, this is not my self.’ | T: What is nonself should be seen as it really is with correct wisdom thus: ‘This is not mine, this I am not, this is not my self.’
